{"text": "appliedbiosystems\n\nSPECIFICATION SHEET ProFlex PCR System\n\nProFlex PCR System\n\n\u2122 \u2122\n\nThe Applied Biosystems\u2122 ProFlex\u2122 PCR System is the only thermal cycler\nthat allows simultaneous remote access by three users to control three\nindependent blocks.\n\ne Accessible by multiple users\u2014run three experiments with three\nindependently controlled blocks\n\ne Flexible block configuration\u2014accepts five types of thermal blocks for\nthermal optimization and throughput options\n\n\u00a2 Convenient remote access\u2014connect via the cloud or a mobile device and\nmonitor your instrument from anywhere with a free mobile app\n\n3x3: ell, m 2x9 ell, 2 x flat block for 2 x 384-well,\nBlock format independent control 96-well, 0.2 0.2 m chips and arrays 02\n\nRum ime Perform complete Highest throughput\nexperiments Crpiiimeaetitemn otis High throughput capability: Bx Sore High throughput in\n[RESTS at once or at wan tl eI in 96-well format  APPlied Biosystems\u201d 38) Well format\nGlineni times Applied Biosystems\u2122 OpenArray\u2122 Plate*\nVeriFlex\u2122 Block or 24 x 20K Chip**\n\n6.0\u00b0C/sec 6.0\u00b0C/sec 3.0\u00b0C/sec 1.6\u00b0C/sec 3.0\u00b0C/sec\n4.4\u00b0C/sec 4.4\u00b0C/sec 1.6\u00b0C/sec NA 1.6\u00b0C/sec\n+0.25\u00b0C (35-99.9\u00b0C)\n<0.5\u00b0C (80 sec after reaching 95\u00b0C)\n27.2 x 33.0 x 56.5 cm (10.6 x 13 x 22 in.)\nJweight = 18.8 kg (41 Ib) 18.8 kg (41 Ib) 19.3 kg (42.5 Ib) 19.6 kg (43.2 Ib) 20.4 kg (45 Ib)\n10-80 pL 10-80 pL 10-100 pL 33 nL 5-20 uL\nUSB, onboard\n8.4 in. color thin-film transistor (TFT) LCD\nPower sid 100-240 V, 50-60 Hz, max. 950 VA\n\n2 temperature zones 6 temperature\n\nVeriFlex Blocks per block zones, 25\u00b0C range NA NA NA\n(6\u00b0C zone-to-zone) (6\u00b0C zone-to-zone)\nCatt Moe Gauls 4484073 4484075 4484076 4484078 4484077\n\nsystem (base and block)\n\nCat. No.: Block\n(includes block only) 4483638 4483637 4484071 4484074 4484072\n\n* OpenArray Plate is compatible with the Applied Biosystems\u2122 QuantStudio\u2122 12K Flex Real-Time PCR System.\n** 20K Chip is compatible with the Applied Biosystems\u2122 QuantStudio\u2122 3D Digital PCR System.\nt+ For 2 x 96-well and 2 x flat block format, temperature uniformity is for each block. Overall temperature uniformity across two blocks is\n<0.75\u00b0C (30 sec after reaching 95\u00b0C)\n\nThermoFisher\nFind out more at thermofisher.com/proflex SCIENTIFIC\n\nFor Research Use Only. Not for use in diagnostic procedures. \u00a9 2016, 2020 Thermo Fisher Scientific Inc. All rights reserved.\nAll trademarks are the property of Thermo Fisher Scientific and its subsidiaries unless otherwise specified. COL23876 0120",
